category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libaudiofile-devel libbz2-devel libgcrypt-devel libglib2.0-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "ZX Spectrum emulator support library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libspectrum is a library designed to make the input and output of some ZX
Spectrum emulator files slightly easier."
